      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "You can avoid including a large font atlas with your world by having TextMesh Pro use a dynamic font asset. This will cause it to render the characters as they are needed the same way Unity's built-in Text component does. Here's a tutorial from the TextMesh Pro developer: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NY1xKqCIj3c",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
